<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>30-Day Pure Impact Golf Coaching</title>
  <meta name="description" content="30 days of personal online golf coaching with Grant Garrison. Send your swing, get personal analysis, clear priorities and ongoing feedback through CoachNow. US$150 one-time." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0b0f0d;
      --panel:#121815;
      --panel2:#17201b;
      --text:#f5f7f5;
      --muted:#b8c1bb;
      --green:#7be08b;
      --green2:#47c96a;
      --line:#2a352e;
      --white:#ffffff;
      --max:1080px;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
      background:var(--bg);
      color:var(--text);
      line-height:1.55;
    }
    a{color:inherit}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
    .topbar{
      position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;
      background:rgba(11,15,13,.94);
      backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .topbar-inner{
      min-height:68px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px
    }
    .brand{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:14px}
    .brand span{color:var(--green)}
    .mini-cta,.cta{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      text-decoration:none;font-weight:900;border-radius:999px;
      background:var(--green);color:#071109;
      transition:.2s ease;
      box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(71,201,106,.18);
    }
    .mini-cta{padding:11px 17px;font-size:14px}
    .cta{padding:17px 26px;font-size:18px;width:100%;max-width:390px}
    .mini-cta:hover,.cta:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);background:#8ce89a}
    .hero{padding:74px 0 54px}
    .eyebrow{
      color:var(--green);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;
      text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:18px
    }
    h1{
      font-size:clamp(44px,8vw,82px);
      line-height:.97;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0 0 24px;
      max-width:900px;
    }
    .lead{
      font-size:clamp(19px,2.6vw,27px);
      color:#d8dfda;max-width:780px;margin:0 0 28px
    }
    .offer{
      display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 16px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 26px
    }
    .price{font-size:30px;font-weight:950}
    .offer-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}
    .trustline{margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .section{padding:64px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
    .kicker{color:var(--green);font-weight:850;font-size:14px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:12px}
    h2{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 20px}
    .section p{font-size:18px;color:#d3dbd6;max-width:800px}
    .quote{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel2),var(--panel));
      border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:34px;
      font-size:clamp(27px,4.5vw,45px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.08;
      letter-spacing:-.03em
    }
    .quote em{font-style:normal;color:var(--green)}
    .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:32px}
    .step{
      background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:20px;padding:22px;min-height:190px
    }
    .num{
      width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;
      background:var(--green);color:#071109;font-weight:950;margin-bottom:22px
    }
    .step h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:19px}
    .step p{font-size:15px;margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .benefits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:28px}
    .benefit{
      padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:var(--panel)
    }
    .benefit strong{display:block;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:6px}
    .benefit span{color:var(--muted)}
    .proofbox{
      background:#eff8f0;color:#0c1710;border-radius:28px;padding:38px;
    }
    .proofbox .kicker{color:#1b7f35}
    .proofbox p{color:#324238}
    .coach{
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:34px;align-items:start
    }
    .coach-card{
      border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);border-radius:24px;padding:28px
    }
    .coach-card .big{font-size:42px;font-weight:950;line-height:1}
    .coach-card .small{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .faq details{
      border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px 0
    }
    .faq details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:18px;font-weight:800}
    details p{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:16px}
    .final{
      text-align:center;padding:78px 0 84px;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#101713,#0b0f0d)
    }
    .final h2{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 20px}
    .final p{margin:0 auto 24px;max-width:690px}
    footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .contact{color:var(--green)}
    @media (max-width:860px){
      .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
      .coach{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
    @media (max-width:600px){
      .hero{padding:52px 0 42px}
      .section{padding:48px 0}
      .steps,.benefits{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .step{min-height:0}
      .topbar-inner{min-height:62px}
      .mini-cta{padding:9px 13px;font-size:13px}
      .brand{font-size:12px}
      .quote,.proofbox{padding:26px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="wrap topbar-inner">
    <div class="brand">PURE IMPACT <span>GOLF</span></div>
    <a class="mini-cta" href="https://book.stripe.com/6oU8wPdIqddVccG42A2Fa0o">Start My 30 Days</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">30-Day Personal Online Golf Coaching</div>
      <h1>Stop guessing what’s wrong with your golf swing.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Work directly with Grant Garrison for 30 days. Send your swing, understand what is really affecting your impact and ball flight, and get a clear plan for what to work on next.</p>

      <div class="offer">
        <div class="price">US$150</div>
        <div class="offer-note">One payment · No subscription · 30 days from purchase</div>
      </div>

      <a class="cta" href="https://book.stripe.com/6oU8wPdIqddVccG42A2Fa0o">START MY 30 DAYS →</a>
      <div class="trustline">Personal coaching delivered through CoachNow.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="quote">“I don’t teach the golf swing. <em>I teach impact.</em>”</div>
      <p style="margin-top:26px">Every golfer is different. I’m not going to force you into somebody else’s idea of the perfect golf swing. I want to find out why your ball is doing what it’s doing, identify the impact conditions that matter most, and help you improve them.</p>
      <p><strong>No guessing. No endless position chasing. A clear direction built around your golf.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">How it works</div>
      <h2>Your swing. My eyes on it. For 30 days.</h2>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">1</div>
          <h3>Send Your Swing</h3>
          <p>Upload your swing through CoachNow and tell me what you’re seeing, feeling or struggling with.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">2</div>
          <h3>I Analyse It</h3>
          <p>I assess your swing, impact and ball flight and identify what actually deserves your attention.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">3</div>
          <h3>Get Your Plan</h3>
          <p>I simplify the problem and give you clear priorities, drills and practice direction.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">4</div>
          <h3>Show Me Progress</h3>
          <p>Practise it, film it and send it back so I can see what changed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">5</div>
          <h3>Keep Improving</h3>
          <p>We keep refining the plan and moving your ball striking forward throughout your 30 days.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">What you are buying</div>
      <h2>Direction — not more golf tips.</h2>
      <p>The problem for most golfers isn’t a lack of information. It’s knowing which information actually applies to their swing. My job is to cut through the noise and keep you focused on what matters now.</p>

      <div class="benefits">
        <div class="benefit"><strong>Personal swing reviews</strong><span>Feedback on your swing, impact and ball flight.</span></div>
        <div class="benefit"><strong>Clear practice direction</strong><span>Specific priorities instead of a ten-point checklist.</span></div>
        <div class="benefit"><strong>Ongoing follow-up</strong><span>Send progress during your 30 days and keep building from there.</span></div>
        <div class="benefit"><strong>Direct access through CoachNow</strong><span>Ask questions inside the coaching space and get personal guidance.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="proofbox">
        <div class="kicker">The Pure Impact philosophy</div>
        <h2>12 swings. One ball flight.</h2>
        <p>If completely different-looking swings can produce the same ball flight, what are we really trying to perfect?</p>
        <p><strong>The golf ball doesn’t care what your swing looks like. It responds to impact.</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap coach">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">Your coach</div>
        <h2>Grant Garrison</h2>
        <p>I’ve spent more than 40 years coaching golfers. One lesson stands above all the others: every golfer is different.</p>
        <p>I’m not here to rebuild your swing into somebody else’s model. I’m here to understand your ball flight, identify the impact conditions controlling it, and help you make the changes that matter.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="coach-card">
        <div class="big">40+ years</div>
        <div class="small">coaching golfers</div>
        <hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:24px 0">
        <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900">PGA Professional</div>
        <div class="small">Personal online coaching through CoachNow</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section faq">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">Questions</div>
      <h2>Before you start</h2>

      <details>
        <summary>When do my 30 days begin?</summary>
        <p>Your 30 days begin on the day you purchase.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Is this a subscription?</summary>
        <p>No. It is a single US$150 payment for 30 days of personal coaching. There is no automatic renewal.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Where does the coaching happen?</summary>
        <p>Your coaching is delivered through CoachNow, where you can send swing videos, questions and progress updates.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Do I need to have a good golf swing already?</summary>
        <p>No. The coaching is built around your swing, your ball flight and the impact conditions that matter most for you.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What happens after 30 days?</summary>
        <p>Your 30-day coaching period ends. There is no automatic charge. If you want to continue working together, you can choose to do so separately.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">30-Day Pure Impact Coaching</div>
      <h2>Give me 30 days. Stop bouncing from tip to tip.</h2>
      <p>Let me look at your swing, your impact and your ball flight and show you what actually deserves your attention.</p>
      <div class="offer" style="justify-content:center">
        <div class="price">US$150</div>
        <div class="offer-note">One payment · No subscription</div>
      </div>
      <a class="cta" href="https://book.stripe.com/6oU8wPdIqddVccG42A2Fa0o">START MY 30 DAYS →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>© 2026 Pure Impact Golf · Grant Garrison PGA</div>
    <div style="margin-top:8px">Questions? <a class="contact" href="mailto:contact@pureimpactgolf.online">contact@pureimpactgolf.online</a></div>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
